OL,3,GNEWSAEmbroidery on display as town
OL,4,Acelebrates conqueror
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artwork created to mark the 900th
OL,7,Fanniversary of the Battle of Hastings
OL,8,Fis on public display in the town for
OL,9,Fthe first time in several years.
OL,11,FThe Hastings Embroidery, crafted in
OL,12,F1966, tells the story of 900 years of
OL,13,Fhistory, showing "snippets of life"
OL,14,Fover that time, Hastings Borough
OL,15,FCouncil (HBC) said. It went on show at
OL,16,FHastings Town Hall on Saturday and can
OL,17,Fbe seen until October.
OL,19,FFree tickets are available for the
OL,20,Fexhibition, which coincides with the
OL,21,FBayeux Tapestry going on display at the
OL,22,FBritish Museum in London.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
