OL,3,GNEWSAEmbroidery on display as town
OL,4,Acelebrates conqueror
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulia Hilton, deputy leader of HBC,
OL,7,Fdescribed the embroidery as "an
OL,8,Fincredible piece of work" covering 900
OL,9,Fyears of history and Norman heritage.
